---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import aboutPhoto from '../assets/photos/about-chair-yellow.png';
import logoCoral from '../assets/brand/logo-coral.svg';
import { credentials } from '../data/credentials';
import glitterTrail from '../assets/brand/glitter-trail.png';
---

<section id="about" class="about">
	<div class="about-sweep" aria-hidden="true">
		<img
			src={glitterTrail.src}
			width={glitterTrail.width}
			height={glitterTrail.height}
			alt=""
			class="about-glitter"
			loading="lazy"
			decoding="async"
		/>
	</div>
	<div class="about-grid">
		<div class="about-visual">
			<img src={logoCoral.src} alt="" class="section-seal" />
			<h2>About</h2>
			<Image
				src={aboutPhoto}
				alt="Grace Lakey sitting in a tan chair wearing a polka-dot top and olive skirt"
				class="about-photo"
				widths={[400, 800, 1200]}
				sizes="(min-width: 901px) 520px, (min-width: 432px) 384px, 100vw"
				format="webp"
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
			/>
		</div>

		<div class="about-content">
			<p>
				Grace Lakey's whole life changed with a discovery she never saw coming. That unexpected
				plot twist set off a chain reaction: she left corporate America for the unconventional
				world of auctioneering, and never looked back.
			</p>

			<p>
				Grace's work goes way beyond her <em>mad cool</em> bid calling skills. She consults with
				fundraising committees on strategy, emcees events that keep people in their seats (or
				jumping to their feet in a good way), and brings the kind of energy that turns a quiet
				ballroom into a crowd eager to participate. When you see her tagline, "<strong class="tagline">Add a little
				sparkle, raise a lot of money</strong>," know that she means every word. And yes, she can sing,
				too.
			</p>

			<p>
				Grace is a licensed auctioneer. She teaches at three of the largest auction schools in
				the country, competes in bid calling competitions, and co-owns AuctionStream, where she
				hosts weekly live auctions on Whatnot and TikTok with her business partner Gracie.
			</p>

			<p>
				Off the clock, Grace soaks in time with her (now much larger) family and travels around
				the world with her husband, Nate, and their fur-baby, Lady Bird. She is all about chasing
				dreams and making the most out of life.
			</p>

			<div class="cta-line">
				<p class="cta-text">Ready to raise the bar and the paddles? Let's talk.</p>
				<a href="#book" class="button">check availability</a>
			</div>

			<ul class="credentials">
				{credentials.map((credential) => (
					<li class="credential">{credential.label}</li>
				))}
			</ul>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.about {
		position: relative;
		isolation: isolate;
		background-color: var(--cream);
		color: var(--ink);
		padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
	}

	.about-sweep {
		position: absolute;
		top: -7rem;
		left: max(0px, calc((100% - 72rem) / 2 + 2.5rem));
		width: min(720px, 85vw);
		z-index: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.about-glitter {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
		transform: scaleX(-1) rotate(15deg);
		transform-origin: center;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.about-sweep {
			top: -4rem;
			left: 1rem;
			width: min(460px, 90vw);
		}
	}

	.about-grid {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		max-width: 72rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.about-content {
		position: relative;
	}

	.about-visual h2 {
		color: var(--crimson);
		font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 4rem);
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.about-visual {
		max-width: 24rem;
		margin: 0 auto;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.about-visual :global(.about-photo) {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.tagline {
		color: var(--crimson);
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.about-content p {
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.cta-line {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
	}

	.cta-text {
		font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 1.35rem;
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}

	.credentials {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.75rem;
		list-style: none;
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}

	.credential {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
		border: 1.5px solid var(--mustard);
		border-radius: 999px;
		color: var(--ink);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 500;
	}

	@media (min-width: 901px) {
		.about-grid {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
			align-items: start;
			gap: 2.5rem;
		}

		.about-visual {
			margin: 0;
			max-width: none;
			width: 100%;
		}

		.about-content {
			margin-top: calc(48px + 1rem);
		}
	}
</style>
